{"id": "0007917_p0024", "tianyige_id": "0007917", "title": "萬曆十年江北武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1582, "reign_era": "萬曆", "reign_year": 10, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "江北", "province_en": "Jiangbei", "page": 24, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007917_%E8%90%AC%E6%9B%86%E5%8D%81%E5%B9%B4%E6%B1%9F%E5%8C%97%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E8%90%AC%E6%9B%86%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=24", "text": "鳳陽中衛鎮撫司鎮撫李鶴齡〔子壽直隸高郵州人〕\n鳳陽右衛百戶曹遵憲〔宗文直隸合肥縣人〕\n供給官\n鳳陽府照磨鄧官寀〔允師山西蒲州人監生〕\n鳳陽府潁州吏目李見可〔允行江西玉山縣人監生〕\n鳳陽府臨淮縣主簿朱一清〔宜健江西峽江縣人監生〕\n鳳陽府鳳陽縣典史胡鳳翔〔舜儀浙江永康縣人吏員〕\n鳳陽府泗州盱眙縣典史秦朝聘〔應時江西豐城縣人吏員〕\n鳳陽府鳳陽縣王莊驛驛丞汪用賓〔國光直隸婺源縣人承差〕", "banxin": ["武舉錄　十七"], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": false, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": "鳳陽中衛鎮撫司鎮撫李鶴齡〔子壽，直隸高郵州人〕。\n鳳陽右衛百戶曹遵憲〔宗文，直隸合肥縣人〕。\n\n供給官：\n鳳陽府照磨鄧官寀〔允師，山西蒲州人，監生〕。\n鳳陽府潁州吏目李見可〔允行，江西玉山縣人，監生〕。\n鳳陽府臨淮縣主簿朱一清〔宜健，江西峽江縣人，監生〕。\n鳳陽府鳳陽縣典史胡鳳翔〔舜儀，浙江永康縣人，吏員〕。\n鳳陽府泗州盱眙縣典史秦朝聘〔應時，江西豐城縣人，吏員〕。\n鳳陽府鳳陽縣王莊驛驛丞汪用賓〔國光，直隸婺源縣人，承差〕。", "translation_en": "Li Heling 李鶴齡 (courtesy name Zishou 子壽, a native of Gaoyou Department 高郵州, Zhili 直隸), Judge (zhenfu) of the Judge's Office of Fengyang Central Guard 鳳陽中衛鎮撫司.\nCao Zunxian 曹遵憲 (courtesy name Zongwen 宗文, a native of Hefei County 合肥縣, Zhili 直隸), Company Commander (baihu) of Fengyang Right Guard 鳳陽右衛.\n\nSupply Officials (gongjiguan 供給官):\nDeng Guancai 鄧官寀 (courtesy name Yunshi 允師, a native of Puzhou 蒲州, Shanxi 山西, a National University Student [jiansheng]), Record Keeper (zhaomo) of Fengyang Prefecture 鳳陽府.\nLi Jianke 李見可 (courtesy name Yunxing 允行, a native of Yushan County 玉山縣, Jiangxi 江西, a National University Student), Chief of Police (limu) of Yingzhou 潁州, Fengyang Prefecture 鳳陽府.\nZhu Yiqing 朱一清 (courtesy name Yijian 宜健, a native of Xiajiang County 峽江縣, Jiangxi 江西, a National University Student), Assistant Magistrate (zhubu) of Linhuai County 臨淮縣, Fengyang Prefecture 鳳陽府.\nHu Fengxiang 胡鳳翔 (courtesy name Shunyi 舜儀, a native of Yongkang County 永康縣, Zhejiang 浙江, a Lesser Functionary [liyuan]), Jail Warden (dianshi) of Fengyang County 鳳陽縣, Fengyang Prefecture 鳳陽府.\nQin Chaopin 秦朝聘 (courtesy name Yingshi 應時, a native of Fengcheng County 豐城縣, Jiangxi 江西, a Lesser Functionary), Jail Warden of Xuyi County 盱眙縣, Sizhou 泗州, Fengyang Prefecture 鳳陽府.\nWang Yongbin 汪用賓 (courtesy name Guoguang 國光, a native of Wuyuan County 婺源縣, Zhili 直隸, an Agent [chengchai]), Postal Relay Station Master (yicheng) of Wangzhuang Postal Relay Station 王莊驛, Fengyang County 鳳陽縣, Fengyang Prefecture 鳳陽府.", "translation_model": "gemini-4-argon-low (agy)"}
