{"id": "0007917_p0029", "tianyige_id": "0007917", "title": "萬曆十年江北武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1582, "reign_era": "萬曆", "reign_year": 10, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "江北", "province_en": "Jiangbei", "page": 29, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007917_%E8%90%AC%E6%9B%86%E5%8D%81%E5%B9%B4%E6%B1%9F%E5%8C%97%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E8%90%AC%E6%9B%86%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=29", "text": "", "banxin": [], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": true, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": null, "translation_en": null, "translation_model": null}
{"id": "0007917_p0030", "tianyige_id": "0007917", "title": "萬曆十年江北武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1582, "reign_era": "萬曆", "reign_year": 10, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "江北", "province_en": "Jiangbei", "page": 30, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007917_%E8%90%AC%E6%9B%86%E5%8D%81%E5%B9%B4%E6%B1%9F%E5%8C%97%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E8%90%AC%E6%9B%86%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=30", "text": "策\n李逢時\n馬上中六箭\n步下中三箭\n同考試官知州邵　批　兵法以陣爲主而\n縱横闔闢之妙本於一心誠用之南北無不宜者子\n能商確古今而出以胞中之竒異日登壇之選端有\n望矣允宜首薦\n同考試官知州黄　批　抵掌而譚陣法輙\n===\n言言中竅子之識蓋與嫖姚武穆相先後矣異日\n者當一靣之寄吾將持左劵以俟\n同考試官推官蔣　批　古今兵家陣法非\n一子能搜括無遺敷爲水陸陣允見經綸素藴子\n其諸葛李衛公倫與允宜首薦\n同考試官推官李　批　古人陣法皆精藴\n弘畧攸寓子會數千百成畫于胞中而摛以古文詞\n允應髙薦\n同考試官推官胡　批　古人陣法心法也", "banxin": ["武舉録　二十三"], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": false, "has_examiner_comments": true, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": "策\n\n李逢時\n\n馬上中六箭，步下中三箭。\n\n同考試官知州邵批：兵法以陣爲主，而縱横闔闢之妙本於一心。誠用之，南北無不宜者。子能商確古今，而出以胞中之竒，異日登壇之選，端有望矣。允宜首薦。\n\n同考試官知州黄批：抵掌而譚陣法，輙言言中竅。子之識，蓋與嫖姚、武穆相先後矣。異日者當一靣之寄，吾將持左劵以俟。\n\n同考試官推官蔣批：古今兵家陣法非一，子能搜括無遺，敷爲水陸陣，允見經綸素藴。子其諸葛、李衛公倫與？允宜首薦。\n\n同考試官推官李批：古人陣法，皆精藴弘畧攸寓。子會數千百成畫于胞中，而摛以古文詞，允應髙薦。\n\n同考試官推官胡批：古人陣法，心法也。", "translation_en": "Policy Essays\n\nLi Fengshi 李逢時\n\nMounted archery: six hits. Foot archery: three hits.\n\nComment by Associate Examiner Department Magistrate Shao 邵: The art of war takes battle formations as its foundation, while the subtleties of maneuvering, closing, and opening originate in the single mind. If truly put into practice, there is nowhere in the north or south where they would not be suitable. You are able to deliberate upon antiquity and the present and bring forth the marvelous strategies within your breast; in days to come, there is genuinely high hope for your selection to ascend the general's altar. Truly worthy of primary recommendation.\n\nComment by Associate Examiner Department Magistrate Huang 黄: Clapping your hands in animated discussion of battle formations, every single word hits the mark. In insight, you surely rival Piao Yao 嫖姚 [Huo Qubing 霍去病] and Wumu 武穆 [Yue Fei 岳飛]. When in the future you are entrusted with the command of a strategic front, I shall hold the left tally of a contract and wait for its fulfillment.\n\nComment by Associate Examiner Prefectural Judge Jiang 蔣: Among military strategists ancient and modern, battle formations are not of a single kind. You are able to gather them exhaustively without omission and set them forth as naval and land formations, truly demonstrating the statecraft long stored within you. Are you not a peer of Zhuge 諸葛 [Zhuge Liang 諸葛亮] and Duke Wei of Li 李衛公 [Li Jing 李靖]? Truly worthy of primary recommendation.\n\nComment by Associate Examiner Prefectural Judge Li 李: The battle formations of the ancients are all where profound subtleties and grand strategies reside. You have synthesized hundreds and thousands of established plans within your breast and expressed them in ancient prose diction; you truly deserve a high recommendation.\n\nComment by Associate Examiner Prefectural Judge Hu 胡: The battle formations of the ancients are methods of the mind…", "translation_model": "gemini-4-argon-low (agy)"}
