{"id": "0007917_p0044", "tianyige_id": "0007917", "title": "萬曆十年江北武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1582, "reign_era": "萬曆", "reign_year": 10, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "江北", "province_en": "Jiangbei", "page": 44, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007917_%E8%90%AC%E6%9B%86%E5%8D%81%E5%B9%B4%E6%B1%9F%E5%8C%97%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E8%90%AC%E6%9B%86%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=44", "text": "陵夷此夫以目論也彼習見\n夫草昧之雄昌闘闢而扶\n日月勲伐爛焉遂以此曠絕來\n禩不知奕世未嘗一日不需\n才才亦未嘗一日落也藉令\n如東方生之言時平士無所\n施才則亦以其故循習於熈\n===\n恬不獲跅弛萬里而愽通侯\n世爵之賞或有之何至遠不\n逮先臣若蓮與榏然哉\n今天下號極治然北虜啗互市\n雖守羈馽惟謹近亦數苦邉\n東南山海之孽𨯏巢掃穴而\n遺醜猶屋", "banxin": [], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": false, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": "陵夷，此夫以目論也。彼習見夫草昧之雄，昌闘闢而扶日月，勲伐爛焉，遂以此曠絕來禩，不知奕世未嘗一日不需才，才亦未嘗一日落也。藉令如東方生之言，時平士無所施才，則亦以其故循習於熈恬，不獲跅弛萬里，而愽通侯世爵之賞或有之，何至遠不逮先臣，若蓮與榏然哉？今天下號極治，然北虜啗互市，雖守羈馽惟謹，近亦數苦邉；東南山海之孽，𨯏巢掃穴，而遺醜猶屋", "translation_en": "… has gone into decline. Such is the argument of those who judge merely by what meets the eye. They are accustomed to seeing the heroes of the founding era of chaos, who braved the struggles of opening up the realm to uphold the sun and moon, their meritorious achievements shining brightly; and so they deem these unmatched by coming generations. They fail to realize that through succeeding ages there has never been a single day that did not require talent, nor has talent ever fallen into decline for a single day. Even supposing, as Master Dongfang (Dongfang Shuo 東方朔) said, that in times of peace men of service have nowhere to exercise their talents, it may indeed happen that because of this they grow accustomed to peace and tranquility, unable to gallop unbound across ten thousand li to win the rewards of full marquisates and hereditary nobility. Yet how could they fall so far short of the former ministers as the lotus differs from the dyers' weed? Today the realm is proclaimed to be in a state of supreme order. Yet the northern caitiffs, enticed by border markets, though held carefully in check by our halter and tether, have recently also repeatedly harassed the frontiers; and although the lairs and dens of the bandits of the mountains and seas in the southeast have been plowed under and swept clean [?], the remaining miscreants still…", "translation_model": "gemini-4-argon-low (agy)"}
